  "diagnosis": "Normal accepting-loop termination did not cancel children; a child writer constructed before consumption could be discarded unfinished. Accepted sockets outside serving-task ownership also required explicit closure at Stop.",
  "unsuccessfulAttempts": [
    "Cancellation on normal exit passed focused testing but full regression crashed with Deinited NIOAsyncWriter without calling finish().",
    "Delaying writer creation without gating reads dropped some concurrent source requests.",
    "Gating reads passed one full regression but the trace-free repetition still timed out.",
    "Trace instrumentation changed timing; its 100 passing repetitions were not counted as final qualification.",
    "Shutting down event loops before joining serving tasks timed out and produced Cannot schedule tasks on an EventLoop that has already shut down."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "This proves local incomplete HTTP exchange shutdown; domain cancellation around commit and app/account lifecycle still require separate evidence.",
    "All waits/time limits are test harness bounds, not agent session or idle limits."
  ]
